WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.350
The 1960s.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.450
Rights and Revolution.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.750
Indigenous Canadians finally gain the right to vote federally.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:12.125
The Quiet Revolution transforms Quebec.

00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:15.287
Residential schools continue operating.

00:00:15.287 --> 00:00:21.100
The seeds of modern Canadian civil rights are planted amid ongoing systemic failures.
